WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- [Seth] Yeah.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.481
- You got me drunk on
your late night show,

00:00:02.481 --> 00:00:05.778
so it's only fair we
day-drink on my daytime show.

00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:06.611
- Great.

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:07.864
- So, get ready, Meyers!

00:00:07.864 --> 00:00:08.940
(crowd cheering)

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.903
Get ready!

00:00:09.903 --> 00:00:10.736
- I'm very excited.

00:00:10.736 --> 00:00:12.131
- Okay, drinks are coming in.

00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:15.970
Each drink is themed to a
different area of your life.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:16.887
- Oh. That's so exciting.

00:00:16.887 --> 00:00:18.965
- So first up, I know,
you had specialty drinks.

00:00:18.965 --> 00:00:21.693
We only prefer the best here as well.

00:00:21.693 --> 00:00:24.740
- First up we've got the Lucky
Seven in honor of the seventh

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.039
season of Late Night with Seth Meyers.

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:27.577
- [Seth] Oh my God, how 'bout that?

00:00:27.577 --> 00:00:28.410
(crowd cheering)

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.243
Thank you.

00:00:29.243 --> 00:00:31.986
- It's got coffee liquor
for those late nights.

00:00:31.986 --> 00:00:32.819
- Okay.

00:00:32.819 --> 00:00:33.652
- 'Cause we all need caffeine.

00:00:33.652 --> 00:00:36.310
A shot of vodka to help you
get through political jokes.

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.143
- [Seth] Okay.

00:00:37.143 --> 00:00:38.446
- 'Cause there's just
so much potential there.

00:00:38.446 --> 00:00:39.279
There's so much material to pull from.

00:00:39.279 --> 00:00:40.402
- Absolutely.

00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:41.235
Might need two shots.

00:00:41.235 --> 00:00:42.068
- Yeah.

00:00:42.068 --> 00:00:45.777
Gold flakes for the glitzy
Hollywood actors on your show.

00:00:45.777 --> 00:00:46.610
- [Seth] All right.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.641
- And it's on the rocks since
you tape a 30 Rock, get it?

00:00:48.641 --> 00:00:49.474
- [Seth] Okay, great.

00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:50.307
- Okay.
- [Seth] Cheers, here we go.

00:00:50.307 --> 00:00:51.214
- Here we go. (clapping)

00:00:51.214 --> 00:00:53.780
Paper straws, save the turtles.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.655
(crowd cheering)

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.744
- You don't have to drink the whole thing!

00:00:57.744 --> 00:00:58.577
- I don't?

00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:00.555
- Wait!

00:01:00.555 --> 00:01:02.388
I was like, "Don't challenge me, Meyers!"

00:01:02.388 --> 00:01:04.221
- Oh okay, got it.

00:01:04.221 --> 00:01:05.179
- 'Cause I'm so competitive,

00:01:05.179 --> 00:01:06.433
and I don't want to go home hammered.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.850
- This is a real milky drink.

00:01:10.748 --> 00:01:12.481
- I know, I think might get an upset tummy

00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:13.689
from that one, yeah.

00:01:13.689 --> 00:01:14.625
- [Kelly] Mm-hmm, it's great.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.567
- Aside from me, who was your
most memorable... Get it.

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:19.935
Oh, if you would have got...
okay, now I have to try it.

00:01:19.935 --> 00:01:20.768
- All right, come on.

00:01:20.768 --> 00:01:22.745
- I told you I'm competitive.

00:01:22.745 --> 00:01:23.578
Okay, wait.

00:01:23.578 --> 00:01:24.742
Or wait, you throw it and
I'll try and catch it.

00:01:24.742 --> 00:01:25.575
- You think that's a better idea?

00:01:25.575 --> 00:01:26.408
- Oh shoot!

00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:29.144
Yes, okay, are you ready?

00:01:29.144 --> 00:01:30.651
It's way back there! (crowd yelling)

00:01:30.651 --> 00:01:32.318
It's way back there!

00:01:33.276 --> 00:01:34.109
- Oh!

00:01:34.109 --> 00:01:37.500
- You're like, here, the zone, the zone.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.671
Oh! (crowd yelling)

00:01:39.671 --> 00:01:41.752
No wait, I got it.

00:01:41.752 --> 00:01:42.585
I can't get it. (crowd laughing)

00:01:42.585 --> 00:01:44.350
- How do you think in general...?

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.291
- I can't get it.

00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:46.637
I love it when we get together,

00:01:46.637 --> 00:01:48.507
we just do like fraternity games.

00:01:48.507 --> 00:01:49.949
- Yeah, I was gonna say,

00:01:49.949 --> 00:01:51.224
do the interviews go off
the rails this quickly?

00:01:51.224 --> 00:01:52.353
- No.

00:01:52.353 --> 00:01:53.186
Well yes.

00:01:53.186 --> 00:01:54.044
- Okay, good.
- [Kelly] Sometimes, yes.

00:01:54.044 --> 00:01:54.877
- All right, good.

00:01:54.877 --> 00:01:55.970
- It's going how it usually does.

